# Leave the island: the airship to Skywatcher Plateau (Mulgore), then on to Orgrimmar
train ZephrasSouth
go @57.9,80.8 | Take the airship at the Valanaar dock to Skywatcher Plateau in Mulgore.
accept 95350 || Alaana Stormwalker waits where the airship lands.
note Run to Orgrimmar, through the Barrens and Durotar.
getfp Orgrimmar @45.1,63.9,1454 {npc=Doras}
turnin 95350 || Thrall is in Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom.
train Orgrimmar

# On to the shared Horde route: Horde 11-14 Tirisfal Glades
note Run to Durotar.
note Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to Undercity (the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar's front gate).
